OL,3,GNEWSABudget backs Stratford
OL,4,AInternational rail plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has pledged to work with
OL,7,FLondon's City Hall to enable
OL,8,Finternational rail services to stop at
OL,9,FStratford International station for the
OL,10,Ffirst time.
OL,12,FThe commitment, set out in Budget
OL,13,Fdocuments, will see ministers work with
OL,14,Fthe Greater London Authority (GLA) to
OL,15,Fmake the move possible.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
