OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABudget backs Stratford
OL,4,AInternational rail plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FLord Sadiq Khan said he was "delighted"
OL,7,Fafter lobbying for cross-Channel
OL,8,Fservices at the station "for many
OL,9,Fyears", and said the wider Budget would
OL,10,Fhelp support projects including the
OL,11,FBakerloo line extension and West London
OL,12,FOrbital.
OL,14,FHowever, Conservative London Assembly
OL,15,Fmember Susan Hall said the
OL,16,Fannouncements lacked firm funding
OL,17,Fcommitments, arguing there were "no
OL,18,Fpound signs in front of London".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
